isclosure Report&lt;/a>&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;2021 –&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.abbvie.com/content/dam/abbvie-dotcom/uploads/PDFs/2021_Allergan_Greece_Patient_Organization_Report.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Patient Organization Report&lt;/a>&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;2022 –&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://eutransparency.abbvie.com/2022_Allergan_Greece_EFPIA_Report_Final.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Disclosure Report&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>Ireland&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b>&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.transferofvalue.ie/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Disclosure Data&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>Italy&lt;/b>&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;a href=&quot;http://eutransparency.abbvie.com/Allergan_Italy_Supporting_Document_Final.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Nota metodologica per Allergan Spa - Version 2.0 – 07.06.2022&lt;/a>&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;a href=&quot;http://eutransparency.abbvie.com/2020_Allergan_Italy_EFPIA_Report_Final.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Disclosure 2020 – Version 4.0 – 28.07.2023&lt;/a>&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;a href=&quot;http://eutransparency.abbvie.com/2021_Allergan_Italy_EFPIA_Report_Final.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Disclosure 2021 - Version 2.0 - 28.07.2023&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>Luxembourg&lt;/b>&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;2021 –&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://eutransparency.abbvie.com/2021_Allergan_Luxembourg_EFPIA_Report_Final.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Disclosure Data&lt;/a>&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;2022 – No Transfers of Value&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>Netherlands&lt;/b>&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.transparantieregister.nl/home?lang=en-us&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Disclosure Data&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>Poland&lt;/b>&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;a href=&quot;http://eutransparency.abbvie.com/poland/2021/support/web/view.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Methodological Note&lt;/a>&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;2020 – &lt;a href=&quot;http://eutransparency.abbvie.com/poland/2020/web/view.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Disclosure Report&lt;/a>&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;2021 – &lt;a href=&quot;http://eutransparency.abbvie.com/poland/2021/web/view.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Disclosure Report&lt;/a>&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;2022 – &lt;a href=&quot;http://eutransparency.abbvie.com/poland/2022/web/view.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Disclosure Report&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>Portugal&lt;/b>&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;a href=&quot;https://placotrans.infarmed.pt/publico/listagempublica.aspx&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Disclosure Data&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>*Please use Google Chrome to view this link.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>Russia&lt;/b>&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.abbvie.ru/responsibility/partnerships.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Disclosure Data&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>Slovakia&lt;/b>&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nczisk.sk/Statisticke_vystupy/Zverejnovanie_podla_zakona_liekoch_zdravotnickych_pomockach/Sumarne_spravy_o_vydavkoch/Pages/default.aspx&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>MoH Disclosure Data&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>Spain&lt;/b>&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;2020-2021&amp;nbsp;–&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://eutransparency.abbvie.com/spain/2021/support/web/view.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Methodological Note&lt;/a>&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;2020&amp;nbsp;–&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://eutransparency.abbvie.com/spain/2020/web/view.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Disclosure Report&lt;/a>&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;2021&amp;nbsp;–&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://eutransparency.abbvie.com/spain/2021/web/view.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Disclosure Report&lt;/a>&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;2021&amp;nbsp;–&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://preview.abbvie.com/content/dam/abbvie-dotcom/uploads/PDFs/2021_Allergan_Spain_Patient_Organization_Report.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Patient Organization Report&lt;/a>&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;2022&amp;nbsp;–&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-dotcom/uploads/PDFs/Patient-Organization-Report-Allergan-2022.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Patient Organization Report&lt;/a>&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;2022&amp;nbsp;–&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://eutransparency.abbvie.com/spain/2022/web/view.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Disclosure Report&lt;/a>&amp;nbsp;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://eutransparency.abbvie.com/spain/2022/support/web/view.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Methodological Note&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>Sweden&lt;/b>&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;a href=&quot;https://lif.se/etik/vardeoverforing/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Disclosure Data&lt;/a>&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>Switzerland&lt;/b>&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;a href=&quot;http://eutransparency.abbvie.com/Allergan_Switzerland_Supporting_Document_Final.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Methodological Note&lt;/a>&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;2020 –&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://eutransparency.abbvie.com/2020_Allergan_Switzerland_EFPIA_Report_Final.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Disclosure Report&lt;/a>&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;2021 –&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://eutransparency.abbvie.com/2021_Allergan_Switzerland_EFPIA_Report_Final.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Disclosure Report&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>Turkey&lt;/b>&amp;nbsp;–&amp;nbsp;Data submitted per Ministry of Health requirement&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>United Kingdom&lt;/b>&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.abpi.org.uk/our-ethics/disclosure-uk/#4889b2fa&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Disclosure Data&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
